<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopia delays posting sugar tender winner.</title>
<headline>Ethiopia delays posting sugar tender winner.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ethiopia has delayed announcing the winner of a tender to supply 25,000 tonnes of white sugar, officials said.</p>
<p>They said bids were opened on Friday but the tender committee had not yet decided on a winner.</p>
<p>They did not say when an announcement would be made.</p>
</text>
